  "description": "What the design is: A digital collection of 20 high-resolution watercolor-style illustrations featuring royal berry princesses wearing crowns, cute crowned blackberries and strawberries, sweet little princesses, and charming botanical leaf accents.   Included file formats: High-resolution PNG files (300 DPI) with transparent backgrounds, optimized for digital crafting, professional printing, and cutting machines.   Potential use cases:Physical crafting and scrapbooking using Cricut and Silhouette cutting machines.   Sublimation printing for custom berry mugs, fruit-themed tumblers, water bottles, and whimsical home decor blanks.   Print-on-demand (POD) merchandise and commercial physical items for kids’ apparel, boutique branding, and fairy tale gift items.   Custom apparel creation for children’s t-shirts, cozy princess hoodies, canvas treat pouches, and custom everyday tote bags.   Princess-themed event decor, birthday party invitations, greeting cards, wall art prints, and custom planner sticker designs.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>What the design is: A digital collection of 20 high-resolution watercolor-style illustrations featuring royal berry princesses wearing crowns, cute crowned blackberries and strawberries, sweet little princesses, and charming botanical leaf accents.   Included file formats: High-resolution PNG files (300 DPI) with transparent backgrounds, optimized for digital crafting, professional printing, and cutting machines.   Potential use cases:Physical crafting and scrapbooking using Cricut and Silhouette cutting machines.   Sublimation printing for custom berry mugs, fruit-themed tumblers, water bottles, and whimsical home decor blanks.   Print-on-demand (POD) merchandise and commercial physical items for kids’ apparel, boutique branding, and fairy tale gift items.   Custom apparel creation for children’s t-shirts, cozy princess hoodies, canvas treat pouches, and custom everyday tote bags.   Princess-themed event decor, birthday party invitations, greeting cards, wall art prints, and custom planner sticker designs.</p>",
